# AI Media Watch — curated seed channels (Phase 4).
#
# Curation policy (see §2/§4 of AI_MediaWatch_v4.md): the system watches a
# *curated* set of PUBLIC Telegram channels plus analyst-submitted URLs. It does
# NOT crawl platforms. Only add channels that are:
#   1. PUBLIC (joinable; no private/bulk scraping — ToS + credibility),
#   2. FINANCIAL-TOPIC (investing, trading, "passive income", crypto, betting),
#   3. KZ-RELEVANT (Kazakhstan audience; RU / KK / code-switched content).
#
# Copy to `config/channels.yaml` and edit. Entries may be a bare username string
# or a mapping: {name: <username>, entity: <username-or-id>}.

